        "text": "I apologize, Diego. It appears that by not specifying the amount, the system processed a full refund of $455.00 instead of the 20% credit. \n\nI am very sorry for this error. Since I cannot reverse a refund, I have escalated this to our billing department to look into the overpayment. They will reach out to you shortly to resolve this."
